  "features": [
    "> Key Features: • 9H hardness for maximum protection • HD clarity & responsive touch sensitivity • Anti-fingerprint & smudge resistant coating • Easy alignment tool for bubble-free installation • Edge-to-edge protection for full coverage"
  ],
  "description_text": "Keep your smartphone screen safe and crystal clear with this Tempered Glass Screen Protector. Designed with 9H hardness, it provides superior protection against scratches, drops, and everyday wear. The ultra-thin design ensures HD clarity and smooth touch response, while the anti-fingerprint coating keeps your screen spotless. The package includes an easy alignment installation frame, making bubble-free application quick and hassle-free. Compatible with most smartphone models, this screen protector is the perfect blend of durability and elegance to keep your device looking brand new. Key Features: • 9H hardness for maximum protection • HD clarity & responsive touch sensitivity • Anti-fingerprint & smudge resistant coating • Easy alignment tool for bubble-free installation • Edge-to-edge protection for full coverage",
  "description_html": "<div>Keep your smartphone screen safe and crystal clear with this Tempered Glass Screen Protector. Designed with 9H hardness, it provides superior protection against scratches, drops, and everyday wear. The ultra-thin design ensures HD clarity and smooth touch response, while the anti-fingerprint coating keeps your screen spotless.</div>\n<div><br></div>\n<div>The package includes an easy alignment installation frame, making bubble-free application quick and hassle-free. Compatible with most smartphone models, this screen protector is the perfect blend of durability and elegance to keep your device looking brand new.</div>\n<div><br></div>\n<div>Key Features:</div>\n<div><span> • 9H hardness for maximum protection</span></div>\n<div><span> • HD clarity &amp; responsive touch sensitivity</span></div>\n<div><span> • Anti-fingerprint &amp; smudge resistant coating</span></div>\n<div><span> • Easy alignment tool for bubble-free installation</span></div>\n<div><span> • Edge-to-edge protection for full coverage</span></div>"
